BT /F2 11 Tf 48 742 Td (START HERE) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 48 701 Td (What Great Science Fiction Actually) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 48 680 Td (Needs) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 56.8 659.0 Td (Science fiction becomes powerful when a change to reality forces human beings to make choices) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 56.8 647.6 Td (they could never face in ordinary life. The technology, alien, planet, or future society is not the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 56.8 636.2 Td (destination. It is the pressure machine.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.2 Tf 70.0 610.8 Td (The shortest useful definition) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 70.0 599.4 Td (Great science fiction asks: If this impossible-or-not-yet-real thing became real, what would) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 70.0 588.0 Td (it do to people, institutions, relationships, and meaning?) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.2 Tf 78.8 562.6 Td (Ingredient            Question to answer) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.2 Tf 78.8 544.2 Td (BIG IDEA              What changed?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 525.8 Td (RULES                 What can and cannot happen?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 507.4 Td (CONSEQUENCES          What breaks, improves, or mutates because of it?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 489.0 Td (HUMAN                 Whose life becomes impossible?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 470.6 Td (DESIRE                What do they desperately want?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 452.2 Td (CONFLICT              Why can they not simply get it?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 433.8 Td (CHOICE                What costly decision must they finally make?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 415.4 Td (MEANING               What question remains after the plot ends?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 56.8 390.0 Td (Do not begin with 5,000 years of history. Begin with the change, the rule, and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 56.8 378.6 Td (person whose life it destroys or transforms.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 48 31 Td (THE SCIENCE FICTION STORY ENGINE) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 554 31 Td (2) Tj ET
