BT /F2 11 Tf 48 742 Td (STEP 2) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 48 701 Td (Give the Idea Rules) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 56.8 680.0 Td (Unlimited powers kill tension. Rules create story. Decide what your speculative element can do,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 56.8 668.6 Td (what it cannot do, who controls it, how much it costs, and where it fails.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.2 Tf 78.8 650.2 Td (Rule dimension         Questions) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 624.8 Td (Access                 Who gets it? Everyone, elites, governments, criminals, children?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 599.4 Td (Cost                   Money, time, energy, lifespan, pain, reputation, risk?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 574.0 Td (Limit                  Range, accuracy, capacity, side effects, irreversibility?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 548.6 Td (Control                Who owns, licenses, bans, audits, or weaponizes it?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 523.2 Td (Failure                How does it malfunction or behave unexpectedly?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 497.8 Td (Exploit                How would a clever person cheat the system?) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.2 Tf 70.0 465.4 Td (The rule of friction) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 70.0 454.0 Td (Every major advantage should create a new vulnerability, dependency, inequality,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 70.0 442.6 Td (temptation, or conflict. If an invention only makes life easier, it is usually a gadget. If it) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 70.0 431.2 Td (rearranges incentives, it can become a world.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 56.8 398.8 Td (Example: memory transfer) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 65.6 387.4 Td (- Memories can be copied, but only once.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 65.6 376.0 Td (- The copy is perfect; the emotional interpretation is not.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 65.6 364.6 Td (- The original brain loses fragments after transfer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 65.6 353.2 Td (- Courts accept transferred memories as evidence, but only with certification.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 65.6 341.8 Td (- A black market emerges for uncertified memories.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 48 31 Td (THE SCIENCE FICTION STORY ENGINE) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 554 31 Td (4) Tj ET
