BT /F2 11 Tf 48 742 Td (STEP 3) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 48 701 Td (Run the Consequence Machine) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 56.8 680.0 Td (Do not ask only what the invention does. Ask what people do because it exists. Then ask what other) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 56.8 668.6 Td (people do in response. This second- and third-order thinking is where believable worlds come from.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.2 Tf 78.8 650.2 Td (Domain             Ask) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 631.8 Td (Family             Who becomes a parent, child, spouse, heir, or burden differently?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 613.4 Td (Money              What becomes valuable? What business disappears?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 595.0 Td (Work               Which skills rise or collapse in value?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 576.6 Td (Law                What becomes legal, illegal, provable, or impossible to enforce?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 558.2 Td (Crime              What new crime becomes possible? What old crime disappears?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 539.8 Td (Power              Who can compel whom? Who becomes newly dependent?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 521.4 Td (War                How does conflict change if this exists?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 503.0 Td (Religion           What beliefs become threatened, strengthened, or reinterpreted?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 484.6 Td (Status             What new trait makes someone admired, feared, pitied, or excluded?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 466.2 Td (Love               How does trust, jealousy, loyalty, or intimacy change?) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 56.8 440.8 Td (Useful technique: Write one consequence. Then repeatedly ask, "And because of that...?" five) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 56.8 429.4 Td (times. You will often reach the story only on consequence #3, #4, or #5.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 48 31 Td (THE SCIENCE FICTION STORY ENGINE) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 554 31 Td (5) Tj ET
endstream
