BT /F1 8.7 Tf 70.0 597.6 Td (Pressure: the speculative world makes those two collide.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 56.8 565.2 Td (Good desires are usually ordinary) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 65.6 553.8 Td (- Protect a child.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 65.6 542.4 Td (- Earn respect.) Tj ET
