BT /F1 8.7 Tf 56.8 396.0 Td (gave society order - before his own clock runs out.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 56.8 377.6 Td (Notice what happened: the idea became a ticking clock, a relationship, a mystery,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 56.8 366.2 Td (and a moral problem at the same time.) Tj ET
