BT /F2 11 Tf 48 742 Td (STEP 5) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 48 701 Td (Build Escalation and the Impossible) Tj ET
BT /F2 16 Tf 48 680 Td (Choice) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 56.8 659.0 Td (Plot should progressively remove easy solutions. Each major event should make the protagonist) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 56.8 647.6 Td (pay more, reveal something worse, or discover that the system is more complicated than expected.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.2 Tf 78.8 629.2 Td (Stage                  Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 610.8 Td (1. Normal              Show how this world works before it breaks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 592.4 Td (2. Disruption          Something impossible, illegal, or personally threatening happens.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 574.0 Td (3. First attempt       The protagonist uses the obvious solution. It partly fails.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 555.6 Td (4. Revelation          They learn the problem is larger or different than assumed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 537.2 Td (5. Cost                Solving it now requires sacrificing something important.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 518.8 Td (6. No return           The character cannot return to ordinary life.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 500.4 Td (7. Impossible choice   Two important values collide; no option is clean.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 78.8 482.0 Td (8. Consequence         Show what the choice changes - personally and systemically.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.2 Tf 70.0 449.6 Td (The climax test) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 70.0 438.2 Td (If the final problem can be solved merely by using a bigger gun, faster computer, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 70.0 426.8 Td (unexplained new power, the story probably has not reached its deepest conflict. The) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.2 Tf 70.0 415.4 Td (strongest climax forces a value judgment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 48 31 Td (THE SCIENCE FICTION STORY ENGINE) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 554 31 Td (7) Tj ET
